		{
			"id":"17ad5405d514d4a9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# 8th Gen. Rock Gods\nCreated by various Elemental Gods in cooperation with the Rock Gods to preside over different kinds of rock. Documented in the Eigth Generation Rocks Star.\n%%\n+300\n%%",
