		{
			"id":"907cdb71574e4717",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# 2nd Gen. Vapor Gods\nCreated to preside over the vapor state of specific gaseous elements, isotopes, and molecules. Created by their Material States. Documented in the Second Generation Vapors Star.\n%%\n+81915\n%%",
			"styleAttributes":{},
