		{"id":"f35331af70e25e6e","type":"text","text":"# 2,562,900\nThe [[Encyclopedia Mysenvaria/Geography/Stars/Harmonic Treaty|Harmonic Treaty]] is published and the Mystery God is created in its wake. The God-War is ended and the [[Encyclopedia Mysenvaria/History/Post-War Era/Post-War Era|Post-War Era]] begins.","x":27940,"y":-5760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"528d1bb41edc97c0","type":"text","text":"# Mystery God\n[[Encyclopedia Mysenvaria/History/Biographies/Gods/Mystery God|Little is known of this God]]. Their domain appears to be related to balance or stability, a 'Harmonic God'. They are a higher-God. Documented in the [[Encyclopedia Mysenvaria/Geography/Stars/Harmonic Treaty|Harmonic Treaty]].\n%%\n+1\n%%\n","x":27940,"y":-5500,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
