		{"id":"798d01757723ba7c","type":"text","text":"# 4313\n\n","x":-14240,"y":-5760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"42e4840d0d1bceab","type":"text","text":"# God of Motion\nCreated by the God of Mechanical of Energy to preside over the motion of entities. Documented in the New Motion Star.\n%%\n+1\n%%","x":-14240,"y":-5020,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"00ff1e95e7393dc6","type":"text","text":"# Electric Gods\nCreated by the God of Electric Energy to preside over various elements of electricity Documented in the Electric System Star.\n\n---\n- Current\n- Voltage\n- Static\n- Conductivity\n- Resistance\n%%\n+5\n%%","x":-14240,"y":-5240,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"6f14b36ebc11b13f","type":"text","text":"# 5799\n\n","x":-13500,"y":-5760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"d0f78fbb8a8a808b","type":"text","text":"# Magnet Gods\nCreated by the God of Magnetic Energy to preside over the different forms of magnetic energy. Documented in the New Magnetism Star.\n\n---\n- Diamagnetism\n- Paramagnetism\n- Ferromagnetism\n- Antiferromagnetism\n- Ferrimagnetism\n%%\n+5\n%%","x":-14240,"y":-4800,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5a1da1c7938757b5","type":"text","text":"# Iodine Isotopes\nThe God of Iodine creates the Iodine Isotope Gods. Documented in the Iodine Isotopes Star.\n%%\n+100\n%%","x":-14980,"y":-2520,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0d084c3f250aa641","type":"text","text":"# 1st Gen. Iron Molecules\nThe God of Iron works with their Isotopes to create the first generation of Iron Molecule Gods. Documented in the First Iron Molecules Star.\n%%\n+1000\n%%","x":-14240,"y":-60,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5da2bede6ed0dc6e","type":"text","text":"# 1st Gen. Neon Molecules\nThe God of Neon works with their Isotopes to create the first generation of Neon Molecule Gods. Documented in the First Neon Molecules Star.\n%%\n+400\n%%","x":-14240,"y":180,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e869d0922e0bb232","type":"text","text":"# 1st Gen. Hydrogen Molecules\nThe God of Hydrogen works with their Isotopes to create the first generation of Hydrogen Molecule Gods. Documented in the First Hydrogen Molecules Star.\n%%\n+400\n%%","x":-14240,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6bbbc9b3f2c5fad7","type":"text","text":"# Energy Gods\nCreated by Kinetic and Potential Energy to preside over basal forms of energy. It's unclear how many of these Gods there are. Documented in the New Energy Division Star.\n\n---\n- Chemical Energy\n- Nuclear Energy\n- Rest\n- Radiant Energy\n- Chromodynamic Energy\n- Mechanical Energy\n- Ionizing Energy\n- Thermal Energy\n- Magnetic Energy\n- Electric Energy\n- Gravitational Energy\n%%\n+11\n%%","x":-14980,"y":-5240,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"7ae307925d43e91e","type":"text","text":"# Past, Present, and Future\n[[Encyclopedia Mysenvaria/History/Biographies/Gods/Gods of Past, Present, and Future|AKA the Time Trinity]]. Time is initially hesitant, but is coaxed by Matter and Energy into subdividing their domain. Documented in the Dynamic Time Star.\n%%\n+3\n%%","x":-14980,"y":-5500,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a2b52c5856086a9b","type":"text","text":"# 2022\nCarbon creates the first Isotope Gods, motivating others to do the same. Carbon's Isotopes come together to create the first Molecular Gods too. Time creates the Time Trinity. Energy duo create the Energy Gods.","x":-14980,"y":-5760,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"78a4b88713df4022","type":"text","text":"# 15\n1. First Isotopes Star\n2. Helium Isotopes Star\n3. Dynamic Time Star\n4. First Molecules Star\n5. Silicon Isotopes Star\n6. Nitrogen Isotopes Star\n7. New Energy Division Star\n8. Iron Isotopes Star\n9. First Silicon Molecules Star\n10. Structure Star\n11. Neon Isotopes Star\n12. Iodine Isotopes Star","x":-14980,"y":5720,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"7e50e1fd51627882","type":"text","text":"# 26\n1. Silver Isotopes Star\n2. New Motion Star\n3. First Iron Molecules Star\n4. Oxygen Isotopes Star\n5. Tin Isotopes Star\n6. Electric System Star\n7. First Neon Molecules Star\n8. New Magnetism Star\n9. Hydrogen Isotopes Star\n10. First Hydrogen Molecules Star\n11. Thulium Isotopes Star","x":-14240,"y":5720,"width":400,"height":380},
		{"id":"e9282e528dbf86a7","type":"text","text":"# Nitrogen Isotopes\nThe God of Nitrogen creates the Nitrogen Isotope Gods. Documented in the Nitrogen Isotopes Star.\n%%\n+40\n%%","x":-14980,"y":-3180,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"5"},
